=== A. field / S-box arithmetic ===
p              = 18446744069414584321
p-1            = 18446744069414584320 = 2^32 * (2^32-1)? True
2^32-1 factors = 3*5*17*257*65537 = 4294967295 (equal: True)
  gcd( 2, p-1) = 2  -> x^2 is a permutation: False
  gcd( 3, p-1) = 3  -> x^3 is a permutation: False
  gcd( 4, p-1) = 4  -> x^4 is a permutation: False
  gcd( 5, p-1) = 5  -> x^5 is a permutation: False
  gcd( 6, p-1) = 6  -> x^6 is a permutation: False
  gcd( 7, p-1) = 1  -> x^7 is a permutation: True
  gcd(11, p-1) = 1  -> x^11 is a permutation: True
log2(p)        = 64.0000 bits per field element
  BabyBear 2^31-2^27+1: smallest permutation power in {3,5,7} = [7]
  KoalaBear 2^31-2^24+1: smallest permutation power in {3,5,7} = [3]
  Mersenne31 2^31-1: smallest permutation power in {3,5,7} = [5]

=== B. capacity needed for a stated collision level ===
  Goldilocks 64-bit: target  94 bits -> capacity >= 3 elements (192 capacity bits)
  Goldilocks 64-bit: target 106 bits -> capacity >= 4 elements (256 capacity bits)
  Goldilocks 64-bit: target 128 bits -> capacity >= 5 elements (320 capacity bits)
  31-bit field: target  94 bits -> capacity >= 7 elements (217 capacity bits)
  31-bit field: target 106 bits -> capacity >= 7 elements (217 capacity bits)
  31-bit field: target 128 bits -> capacity >= 9 elements (279 capacity bits)

