=== E. unrolled-leaf sponge: k permutations per leaf, no shift needed ===
  leaves L = n_abs/(8k); leaf perms = k*L = n_abs/8; tree nodes = L-1
  total/linear-sponge ratio = 1 + 1/k  (k=1 is the draft's binary tree)
    k=  1 permutations per leaf -> overhead factor 2.0000   plane families 1+1
    k=  2 permutations per leaf -> overhead factor 1.5000   plane families 2+1
    k=  4 permutations per leaf -> overhead factor 1.2500   plane families 4+1
    k=  8 permutations per leaf -> overhead factor 1.1250   plane families 8+1
    k= 16 permutations per leaf -> overhead factor 1.0625   plane families 16+1
    k= 64 permutations per leaf -> overhead factor 1.0156   plane families 64+1
    Mistral int16, k= 1: perms=  262143 values=  30932874 rows= 1888 sites=  236 proof=   4833280 B
    Mistral int16, k= 4: perms=  163839 values=  19333002 rows= 1180 sites=  590 proof=   4833280 B
    Mistral int16, k= 8: perms=  147455 values=  17399690 rows= 1062 sites= 1062 proof=   6524928 B

=== F. D18's SHA-256 figure, and what the draft proposes to do to it ===
  one Mistral int16 endpoint = 4194304 B = 65536 SHA-256 compressions
  record central, linear chain (the D18 basis)  : lookups   22.8%  words  3.35%    3.23 s =   5.5% of the public pass
  record central, x2 binary tree (draft SO-7)   : lookups   45.7%  words  6.70%    6.46 s =  11.1% of the public pass
  record central, x(1+1/8) unrolled leaves      : lookups   25.7%  words  3.77%    3.63 s =   6.2% of the public pass
  drafter's own SHA count, linear chain         : lookups   73.1%  words  3.35%    6.02 s =  10.3% of the public pass
  drafter's own SHA count, x2 tree              : lookups  146.1%  words  6.70%   12.04 s =  20.6% of the public pass

